                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <span>Lighting</span>
                                <strong> 2 photoperiods · 6 h + 4 h </strong>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <span>CO₂</span>
                                <strong> 2 bpm during photoperiod </strong>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <span>Fish</span>
                                <strong>
                                    Hyphessobrycon pulchripinnis ·
                                    Hyphessobrycon sweglesi · Nematobrycon
                                    palmeri · Carnegiella strigata · Corydoras
                                    elegans · Crossocheilus oblongus
                                </strong>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <span>Other inhabitants</span>
                                <strong>
                                    Amano shrimp · Neocaridina · snails ·
                                    microfauna
                                </strong>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <span>Plants</span>
                                <strong>
                                    Echinodorus uruguayensis · Cryptocoryne
                                    wendtii · Cryptocoryne undulata · Hygrophila
                                    stricta · Bolbitis heudelotii
                                </strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </aside>
